\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi ,$ where $n$ is an integer.\n\nTherefore, the domain of the vector-valued function $f(t)$ is \n\n$$\nt\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\\,t\\ne \\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi ,\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer."} :step/id #uuid "afc5168b-5251-58d8-8fc1-8965074ea6cd" :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186411591}}] :activity/title "The Domain of a Vector-Valued Function" :activity/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :activity.type/review} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186411590}] [{:activity/course {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186046659} :activity/first-step {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186420096} :activity/id #uuid "d63840d2-3609-5c32-bdc9-4fe9ce0a42cd" :activity/scope {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049186 :topic/id #uuid "e1c10e80-3811-5fcd-98a3-8118c49347e4" :topic/math-academy-id 1737} :activity/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186420094 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186420093 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "54811e57-5329-5901-9031-55945bdb3aaf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{4}+\\pi n" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186420082} {:answer/id #uuid "656b42d3-126c-5abb-9880-9e0fc6a9e621" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{2}+2\\pi n" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186420083} {:answer/id #uuid "6d5d9399-1eaf-57c4-b24e-dd1b89bcd1e1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi n}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186420085} {:answer/id #uuid "976cc8f2-04f3-53c2-a86c-c645ed2fbec5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi n}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186420087} {:answer/id #uuid "da650f9b-762e-5944-b6e9-28cdf4865151" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{4}+\\frac{\\pi n}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186420089}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186420082} :answer-field/id #uuid "02673689-46fa-584e-88ff-1a1c967a1b0b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 175921860454